  "solution": {
    "text": "In damped oscillation <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0139_e89999165a9f.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 185px;\" /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />In the circuit<br /><math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Comparing equation (i) and (ii)<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>"
